# 26. Instructional Sequence

Week 9 is a full five-day instructional week, structured around consolidation rather than new instruction.

---

# 27. Day 1 — Retrieve: Numbers, Fractions & Decimals

## Opening

Present the full Quarter 1 Skill Map (Section 5). Ask students to rate their own confidence in each skill, 1–5, before any retrieval begins.

